OL,3,GNEWSAExtra #500m for NHS in Welsh
OL,4,Abudget as Reform politicians boycott
OL,5,Athe Senedd
OL,6,
OL,7,FSenedd members are reacting to the
OL,8,Fannouncement of the Welsh government's
OL,9,Ffirst draft budget under Plaid Cymru
OL,11,FDetails of the tax and spending plans
OL,12,Fshow an extra #500m for the NHS, but
OL,13,Fother public services could still feel
OL,14,Fthe pinch
OL,16,FThere are no tax rises, with Finance
OL,17,FMinister Elin Jones saying raising the
OL,18,FWelsh version of stamp duty or income
OL,19,Ftax would have been counterproductive
OL,20,Fto helping with the cost of living
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
